SUMMARY:ICT: The Laugh Track
LOCATION:Beverly O'Neill - Long Beach Convention and Entertainment Center\,
 
 Long Beach
DESCRIPTION:Age 2 yrs+ require a ticket for entry A WEST COAST PREMIERE Wen
 
dy MacLeod's comedy\, The Laugh Track\, takes us behind the scenes of I Lov
 
e Lucy. Based on the real-life experiences of Hollywood's first female TV w
 
riter\, Madelyn Pugh\, this play shines light on the inner workings of Amer
 
ica's beloved sitcom and the woman who punched up the jokes\, fought for he
 
r career\, and paved the way for women in the writers room. Fast-paced and 
 
full of wit\, The Laugh Track brings familiar characters to life\, while pr
 
oving that comedy is not a man's job. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmas
 
ter.com/ict-the-laugh-track-long-beach-california-11-06-2026/event/0B0064F8
 
AF593C6E
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/ict-the-laugh-track-long-beach-california-
 
11-06-2026/event/0B0064F8AF593C6E
