DESCRIPTION:The Moroccan Lounge Presents: Ebony Loren with REBBY [November 
 
8\, 2026 / Doors 6:30pm / $20 adv / $25 dos / All Ages] Ebony Loren is a 25
 
-year-old singer-songwriter originally from Milwaukee\, Wisconsin\, current
 
ly based in Los Angeles. She has been releasing music since 2020\, developi
 
ng a sound rooted in acoustic pop with influences in R&B and jazz. In Novem
 
ber 2025\, she released her debut album\, Work in Progress\, a reflection o
 
f navigating her twenties\, self-discovery\, and the growing pains of adult
 
hood. The album explores themes of nostalgia\, imposter syndrome\, overwhel
 
m of busy adult life\, and acknowledging your flaws while still finding sel
 
f-love. Having built her fanbase organically\, and largely independently\, 
 
Ebony takes pride in creating music that feels personal\, with a focus on c
 
onnecting with listeners and making them feel seen. Tickets & info: https:/
 
